#: source/experimental-features/bleeding-edge.rst:2
msgid "Welcome to the bleeding edge!"
msgstr "欢迎来到最前沿！"

#: source/experimental-features/bleeding-edge.rst:4
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab is open source because our intention is to grow a community of "
"open collaboration for robotic simulation. We believe that robust tools are "
"crucial for the future of robotics."
msgstr "Isaac Lab 是开源的，因为我们的目的是为机器人模拟建立一个开放协作的社区。我们相信强大的工具对机器人技术的未来至关重要。"

#: source/experimental-features/bleeding-edge.rst:7
msgid ""
"Sometimes new features may require extensive changes to the internal "
"structure of Isaac Lab. Directly integrating such features before they are "
"complete and without feedback from the full community could cause serious "
"issues for users caught unaware."
msgstr ""
"有时候，新增功能可能需要对 Isaac Lab "
"的内部结构进行广泛更改。在功能完全完成之前直接集成这些功能，并没有得到整个社区的反馈可能会给毫不知情的用户带来严重问题。"

#: source/experimental-features/bleeding-edge.rst:11
msgid ""
"To address this, major and experimental features are developed in the "
"``isaaclab_contrib`` package and released as experimental features. This "
"way, the community can experiment with and contribute to a feature before it"
" is fully integrated, reducing the likelihood of being derailed by "
"unexpected errors."
msgstr ""
"为此，重要的新功能和实验性功能会先在 ``isaaclab_contrib`` "
"包中开发，并以实验性功能发布。社区可在功能完全集成前试用并参与改进，减少意外错误对正常开发的影响。"

#: source/experimental-features/bleeding-edge.rst:16
msgid "The ``isaaclab_contrib`` Package"
msgstr "``isaaclab_contrib`` 包"

#: source/experimental-features/bleeding-edge.rst:18
msgid ""
"The ``source/isaaclab_contrib`` folder is the **community incubator** for "
"Isaac Lab. It provides a collection of specialized robot types, actuator "
"models, sensors, controllers, and other components that extend the core "
"framework for specific use cases. Contributions here are:"
msgstr ""
"``source/isaaclab_contrib`` 目录是 Isaac Lab 的 **社区孵化区** "
"，提供专门的机器人类型、执行器模型、传感器、控制器等组件，为特定用途扩展核心框架。这里的贡献："

#: source/experimental-features/bleeding-edge.rst:22
msgid "Actively maintained and supported by the community"
msgstr "由社区积极维护和支持"

#: source/experimental-features/bleeding-edge.rst:23
msgid ""
"Developed openly so the broader community can provide feedback before a "
"wider release"
msgstr "公开开发，使更多社区成员能在广泛发布前提供反馈"

#: source/experimental-features/bleeding-edge.rst:24
msgid ""
"Candidates for eventual integration into the core Isaac Lab packages once "
"they mature"
msgstr "成熟后可考虑集成到 Isaac Lab 核心包"

#: source/experimental-features/bleeding-edge.rst:26
msgid ""
"The package follows Isaac Lab's standard extension structure and can be "
"installed with optional extras that pull in only the dependencies needed for"
" the features you use:"
msgstr "该包遵循 Isaac Lab 的标准扩展结构，可以选择可选依赖组安装，只引入所用功能需要的依赖："

