#: source/experimental-features/bleeding-edge.rst:48
msgid "**Visuo-Tactile Sensor** (TacSL)"
msgstr "**视觉触觉传感器** （TacSL）"

#: source/experimental-features/bleeding-edge.rst:49
msgid ""
"GPU-accelerated simulation of vision-based tactile sensors with elastomer "
"deformation, RGB tactile images, and per-taxel force fields."
msgstr "GPU 加速的视觉触觉传感器仿真，包括弹性体变形、RGB 触觉图像和每个触觉单元的力场。"

#: source/experimental-features/bleeding-edge.rst:51
msgid ":doc:`visuo_tactile_sensor`"
msgstr ":doc:`visuo_tactile_sensor`"

#: source/experimental-features/bleeding-edge.rst:52
msgid "**RL Post-Training for VLA Models** (RLinf)"
msgstr "**VLA 模型的强化学习后训练** （RLinf）"

#: source/experimental-features/bleeding-edge.rst:53
msgid ""
"Reinforcement learning fine-tuning of Vision-Language-Action models (e.g., "
"GR00T, OpenVLA) using RLinf's scalable PPO / Actor-Critic / SAC "
"infrastructure."
msgstr ""
"通过 RLinf 可扩展的 PPO / Actor-Critic / SAC 基础设施，对 GR00T、OpenVLA 等视觉-语言-"
"动作模型进行强化学习微调。"

#: source/experimental-features/bleeding-edge.rst:55
msgid ":doc:`rlinf_vla_posttraining`"
msgstr ":doc:`rlinf_vla_posttraining`"

#: source/experimental-features/bleeding-edge.rst:56
msgid "**Multirotor Systems**"
msgstr "**多旋翼系统**"

#: source/experimental-features/bleeding-edge.rst:57
msgid ""
"Full simulation support for multirotor aerial vehicles (quadcopters, "
"hexacopters, octocopters), including the "
":class:`~isaaclab_contrib.assets.Multirotor` asset, "
":class:`~isaaclab_contrib.actuators.Thruster` actuator with asymmetric motor"
" dynamics, and :class:`~isaaclab_contrib.mdp.actions.ThrustAction` MDP "
"terms."
msgstr ""
"完整支持多旋翼飞行器（四旋翼、六旋翼、八旋翼）仿真，包括 :class:`~isaaclab_contrib.assets.Multirotor` "
"资产、具有非对称电机动力学的 :class:`~isaaclab_contrib.actuators.Thruster` 执行器，以及 "
":class:`~isaaclab_contrib.mdp.actions.ThrustAction` MDP 项。"

#: source/experimental-features/bleeding-edge.rst:60
msgid ""
"API reference: :mod:`~isaaclab_contrib.assets`, "
":mod:`~isaaclab_contrib.actuators`, :mod:`~isaaclab_contrib.mdp`"
msgstr ""
"API 参考： :mod:`~isaaclab_contrib.assets` 、 :mod:`~isaaclab_contrib.actuators`"
" 、 :mod:`~isaaclab_contrib.mdp`"

#: source/experimental-features/bleeding-edge.rst:61
msgid "**Geometric Controllers**"
msgstr "**几何控制器**"

#: source/experimental-features/bleeding-edge.rst:62
msgid ""
"Geometric controllers for multirotor attitude, velocity, acceleration, and "
"position tracking on SO(3) (Lee et al.). Suitable for both trajectory "
"following and RL baselines."
msgstr "在 SO(3) 上实现多旋翼姿态、速度、加速度和位置跟踪的几何控制器（Lee 等），适用于轨迹跟踪和强化学习基准。"

#: source/experimental-features/bleeding-edge.rst:64
msgid "API reference: :mod:`~isaaclab_contrib.controllers`"
msgstr "API 参考： :mod:`~isaaclab_contrib.controllers`"

#: source/experimental-features/bleeding-edge.rst:65
msgid "**Newton Solver Coupling**"
msgstr "**Newton 求解器耦合**"

#: source/experimental-features/bleeding-edge.rst:66
msgid ""
"Proxy coupling between MJWarp and VBD. Deformable assets are implemented in "
":mod:`isaaclab_newton.assets`."
msgstr "MJWarp 与 VBD 之间的代理耦合。可变形资产在 :mod:`isaaclab_newton.assets` 中实现。"

#: source/experimental-features/bleeding-edge.rst:68
msgid "API reference: :mod:`~isaaclab_contrib.coupling`"
msgstr "API 参考： :mod:`~isaaclab_contrib.coupling`"

#: source/experimental-features/bleeding-edge.rst:71
msgid "Contributing"
msgstr "参与贡献"

#: source/experimental-features/bleeding-edge.rst:73
msgid ""
"We welcome contributions to ``isaaclab_contrib``! If you have developed "
"specialized robot assets, novel actuator models, custom MDP components, or "
"domain-specific utilities, please follow the Isaac Lab contribution "
"guidelines and open a pull request. See the `contributing guide "
"<https://isaac-sim.github.io/IsaacLab/main/source/refs/contributing.html>`_ "
"for more information."
msgstr ""
"欢迎为 ``isaaclab_contrib`` 贡献代码！如果开发了专用机器人资产、新的执行器模型、自定义 MDP 组件或领域专用工具，请遵循 "
"Isaac Lab 贡献指南并提交 PR。更多信息见 `贡献指南 <https://isaac-"
"sim.github.io/IsaacLab/main/source/refs/contributing.html>`_ 。"
